cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SRF Coating Simulation and Statistical Analysis Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A modular pipeline for simulating and analyzing statistical quality-factor
  distributions, frequency detuning, and quench hot-spot risks in superconducting
  radio-frequency (SRF) cavities with spatially inhomogeneous multilayer
  coatings using continuous surface SPDE Gaussian random fields and
  the generalized transfer-matrix impedance model.
version: 1.0.2
date-released: 2026-10-26
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SamerRajab2003/srf_coating"

